but will want to make sure that they can see this happening on a real network.  the integration/ folder does just that.  I am also thinking that we should have an option for the
cloudtest to keep it up and show the user how to inspect it running - where is the UI?  How can they see the network alive and working while it's online?  And then a manual
command for them to spin down once they are done inspecting it.  I am also thinking the redteam might find this useful to spin up a real network  on gcloud and then use that
surface area to probe against and report findings.  Thoughts?


